# CyberAudit GPT
### RAG · Audit Platform · v1.0

A local, privacy-first cybersecurity audit platform that uses 
Retrieval-Augmented Generation (RAG) to cross-reference network 
inventory data against security documentation, entirely on-premises, 
with no data leaving the machine.

## Stack

- **Frontend:** Streamlit
- **Orchestration & RAG:** AnythingLLM
- **LLM Inference:** Ollama (qwen3-nothink)
- **Vector Store:** AnythingLLM built-in (LanceDB)
- **Documents:** Network inventory CSV + Security PDFs

## Requirements
- Python 3.10+
- [Ollama](https://ollama.com) installed
- [AnythingLLM](https://anythingllm.com) desktop app

